# The Capture the Flag practice ladder: every practice match, one entity of keys each, in the map
# list format. The Practice tab shows one row of tiles for each tier, in the order of this file.
#
# title       The ladder's name in the Practice tab, in an entity of its own.
# gameplay    The gameplay of every match, in the title entity. The ctf module offers only
#             team_deathmatch, which it plays for captures.
# tier        The tier, 1 to 3, which groups entries into rows of at most 3 (required).
# name        The map (required).
# ai          The AI players, by name and separated by spaces (required).
# time_limit  The time limit in minutes. Unset, the level's applies.
#
# Three tiers: 4v4 against the weakest AI players in tier 1, 3v3 against mid AI players in tier
# 2, and 2v2 against the strongest in tier 3. The team with the most captures wins.

{
	title "Capture the Flag"
	gameplay team_deathmatch
}
{
	tier 1
	name longyard-ctf
	time_limit 10
	ai "Hax Gork Creech Nitro Stroggo Cruentus Captain"
}
{
	tier 2
	name longyard-ctf
	time_limit 10
	ai "Bunker Caustic Gladiator Guard Bldseekr"
}
{
	tier 3
	name longyard-ctf
	time_limit 10
	ai "Enforcer Baron Violator"
}
